# Project Structure

```
app/
  api/v1/            # Routers — HTTP layer only
    deps.py          # Shared FastAPI dependencies
    router.py        # Aggregates v1 routers
    system.py        # /health, /ready, /metrics
  core/              # Cross-cutting infra
    config.py        container.py     logging.py     tracing.py
    metrics.py       security.py      rate_limit.py  exceptions.py
    middleware.py    lifespan.py      constants.py   clock.py
    i18n.py          # Translator Protocol + Babel locale resolver (see i18n-l10n.mdc)
  db/                # Engine, session, base, mixins
  models/            # SQLAlchemy ORM models (per-aggregate file)
  schemas/           # Pydantic DTOs (request/response/internal)
  repositories/      # Persistence layer; one per aggregate root
  services/          # Business logic; one per bounded context
  integrations/      # Adapters: cache/, email/, http/, ...
  events/            # Domain events: types.py, registry.py, publisher.py
  workers/           # Celery: celery_app.py, beat_schedule.py, tasks/
  locales/           # gettext catalogs: <locale>/LC_MESSAGES/messages.{po,mo} (see i18n-l10n.mdc)
    en/LC_MESSAGES/  # English source/default
    ar/LC_MESSAGES/  # Arabic
  templates/
    email/           # Per-template, per-locale: <name>/{en,ar}/{subject,html,txt}.j2
  utils/             # Pure helpers; no business logic
tests/
  factories/         # factory_boy classes
  seeders/           # Composed scenarios using factories
  fakes/             # In-memory Protocol implementations
  unit/  integration/  api/  contract/
alembic/             # Migrations
docker/              # Dockerfile (runtime), Dockerfile.dev (lint/tests), entrypoint, healthcheck
babel.cfg            # Babel extraction config (Python + Jinja2)
docs/
  tech-architecture-requirements.md   # Authoritative spec
  architecture-decisions/             # ADRs
  runbooks/
```

## Where new code goes

| Kind of change | Folder |
|---|---|
| HTTP route | `app/api/v1/<resource>.py` (mounted in `router.py`) |
| Business logic | `app/services/<context>_service.py` |
| DB access | `app/repositories/<aggregate>_repo.py` |
| ORM model | `app/models/<aggregate>.py` |
| Pydantic DTO | `app/schemas/<aggregate>.py` |
| External API client | `app/integrations/<provider>/` |
| Background task | `app/workers/tasks/<context>_tasks.py` |
| Domain event | `app/events/types.py` + register in `app/events/registry.py` |
| Email template | `app/templates/email/<name>/<locale>/{subject,html,txt}.j2` (one subdir per locale) |
| Translation key | `_("...")` in code/template → `make i18n-extract && make i18n-update` → translate `app/locales/<locale>/LC_MESSAGES/messages.po` → `make i18n-compile` |
| New locale | `LOCALES_ENABLED += ["xx"]` + `app/locales/xx/LC_MESSAGES/` + email per-locale subdirs (no app code change) |
| Settings | extend `app/core/config.py` (a sub-`BaseModel`) |
| Cross-cutting helper | `app/core/` if infra; `app/utils/` if pure |
| Test factory | `tests/factories/<aggregate>_factory.py` |
| Test scenario | `tests/seeders/` |
| Migration | `alembic/versions/<rev>_<slug>.py` (via `make migration`) |
| ADR | `docs/architecture-decisions/NNNN-title.md` |
| Runbook | `docs/runbooks/<topic>.md` |

## Files that must stay empty in the boilerplate

- `app/models/__init__.py` (besides re-exports added per project)
- `app/repositories/__init__.py` (besides `base.py`)
- `app/workers/tasks/__init__.py` (besides `events_tasks.py`)
- `app/services/__init__.py` (besides `system_service.py`)
